00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:38.190
So to address the rumors that Jack Gleeson
is quitting acting after Game of Thrones you

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:41.370
have to watch a recent interview he did at
Glasgow College.

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:46.280
There was a student that asked him what his
plans for the future were and he responded

00:04:46.280 --> 00:04:53.210
by saying he didn’t think that acting would
interest him as much as doing something else.

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:58.410
Gleeson actually does some cool theater work
with his friends when he’s not filming game

00:04:58.410 --> 00:05:03.030
of thrones, they actually do a puppet show
which will hopefully get posted online in

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:04.030
the future.

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:06.690
But David Benioff and DB Weiss actually said
during a recent interview that they expect

00:05:06.690 --> 00:05:10.950
he’ll go into higher education because he’s
one of those actors who’s really smart in

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:12.530
real life and very interested in university
life.

